    "content_zh": "检查接线是否接好\n检查关门位置是否安装正确\n可以将限位A 往外移一点，看门机是不是可以提前停下来\n还不行的话，拉耳转180度\n可以换限位试试\n如果换了限位，还是不限位的话，可以拆开检查下磁环（新版注塑磁环几乎不会断）\n还可以按照以下方法检查下控制板：",
    "content_en": "Ensure that the wires of the limit switch (BLUE, GREEN, and YELLOW wires of the arm) are not shorted. Confirm that each wire is properly inserted into its corresponding terminal and is not twisted with any other wire.\nPlease reconfirm the close position of your gate. For Push-to-Open Installation Mode, the close position is determined by the gate bracket. Please check if the moving rod is properly retracted as instructed in the picture below when your gate is at the desired close position. Adjust the gate bracket inward a little if necessary.\nIf it does not work, please adjust Limit Switch A a little outward on the arm, then press the remote to close the gate and see if the close position changes. If not so, rotate the Front Mount 180° and test again.\nIf there is still no luck, the limit switch might be defective.\nCheck the Limit Switch: Disconnect the BLUE, GREEN, and YELLOW wires of the arm from the control board. Use two jumper wires to short the ULT, COM & DLT terminals to which the wires were connected, and then press the remote to see if the arm can extend and retract.\nDuring this test, monitor the arm to ensure it doesn’t extend too far. Use the remote to reverse the direction if necessary. If the arm can move in both directions, release the COM terminal and check if the arm stops moving immediately. If the arm stops immediately, the control board is good and the limit switch might be faulty.",
