    "embedding_text": "风会把门吹开 There is Little Play When the Gate is Closed\n1 检查托架是否紧固，门机运行时候是否会晃动，大门铰链最好不要太松\n2观察门被风吹动的时候拉杆会不会伸缩。如果不会，解释大风吹的时候门体晃动是正常的，建议装电子锁\n3 如果会动的话，取下来离合合上，手推拉，是不是可以伸缩，如果会发视频看看",
    "content_zh": "1 检查托架是否紧固，门机运行时候是否会晃动，大门铰链最好不要太松\n2观察门被风吹动的时候拉杆会不会伸缩。如果不会，解释大风吹的时候门体晃动是正常的，建议装电子锁\n3 如果会动的话，取下来离合合上，手推拉，是不是可以伸缩，如果会发视频看看",
    "content_en": "1 Please verify that all post brackets and pivot brackets are securely fastened and remain completely rigid during operation. Additionally, ensure the gate hinges are properly tightened to eliminate excessive play or looseness.\n2 If the brackets are fine, please observe whether the moving-rod will be extended/retracted by the wind. If not, it is the normal case that the gate will be blown open because of the strong wind. Please kindly note that the gate opener is more focused on the function of opening and closing the gate automatically and does not act as a lock. There can be a small opening more or less after gate is closed, especially in windy areas. To solve this issue, TOPENS ET24 electric lock is highly recommended.\n3 If the moving-rod can be moved when the clutch is engaged, please remove the arm from the gate. Then pull/push the moving-rod by hand to see whether it will extend or retract by doing so. If so, please share us a video showing the problem for further assistance. You can directly send the video to my E-mail via the attachment. If the sending is not successful, please share the photo or video link through dropbox, icloud or google drive. Thanks for your understanding and cooperation.",
