    "section": "十三、门机运行慢 Gate Operates Slowly",
    "question": "门机运行慢 Gate Operates Slowly",
    "embedding_text": "门机运行慢 Gate Operates Slowly\n1 监测电压，看是不是有压降\n2 增大遇阻力，缩小缓停止\n3 打开离合手动推拉顺畅不。顺畅的话，机臂拿下来，合上离合，握住拉耳，看看运行速度怎么样。\n4 测电机，是否可以正常速度往两个方向运行\n5 视频展示\nNote：以上都没解决的话，可按下遥控器，监测MOTOR端口的电压， 如果只有13-14V那就是缓停止的电压，可能缓停止错乱了。\n如果有延长线的话，可能还会受延长线的影响，可以断开机臂延长线，将自带的线直接接到控制板看看。",
    "content_zh": "1 监测电压，看是不是有压降\n2 增大遇阻力，缩小缓停止\n3 打开离合手动推拉顺畅不。顺畅的话，机臂拿下来，合上离合，握住拉耳，看看运行速度怎么样。\n4 测电机，是否可以正常速度往两个方向运行\n5 视频展示\nNote：以上都没解决的话，可按下遥控器，监测MOTOR端口的电压， 如果只有13-14V那就是缓停止的电压，可能缓停止错乱了。\n如果有延长线的话，可能还会受延长线的影响，可以断开机臂延长线，将自带的线直接接到控制板看看。",
    "content_en": "1 Detect the voltage of the +BAT- terminals (11#, 12#) on the control board to see whether it can always stay above 22V when the opener is working. If the voltage is fine, please do the following steps. If the voltage is less than 22V, please disconnect all the wired accessories and test it again.\n2 Please power off the system first (disconnect the power source from the +BAT- terminals). And turn the FORCE potentiometer all the way clockwise to increase the stall force, and turn the SOFT STOP potentiometer all the way counter-clockwise to decrease the soft stop period. Then turn on the power and operate the gate opener to run for a complete opening & closing cycle. See whether the gate will open and close all the way in the next opening and closing cycle.\n3 If the problem still persists, please release the clutch on the arm and move the gate manually to see whether the gate can run smoothly in this case. If so, please engage the clutch and take down the arm from the gate. Then hold its front mount as shown below and press the remote to see if the arm can extend and retract at the normal speed. If not so, please check the motor as below.\n4 Connect the red & black wires of the arm to the DC 24V power source directly, the motor should run, and then exchange the polarity of the wires, the motor should run in the opposite direction. If the motor runs in both directions at the normal speed, the motor itself is good.\n5 Please let me know the result one by one. Videos showing the problem are much appreciated for further judgement. You can directly send the video to my E-mail via the attachment. If the sending is not successful, please share the photo or video link through dropbox, icloud or google drive. Thanks for your understanding and cooperation.",
