    "embedding_text": "开门过位不停（拉开门·限位A·开位）Gate Won't Stop at Open Position · Pull-to-Open · Limit A\n症状：开门过位或开门不停（限位A·开位；非关门限位B）\n拉开门安装 For pull-to-open installation\n检查接线是否接好\n检查开门位置是否安装正确\n可以将限位A 往外移一点，看门机是不是可以提前停下来\n还不行的话，拉耳转180度\n可以换限位试试",
    "content_zh": "症状：开门过位或开门不停（限位A·开位；非关门限位B）\n拉开门安装 For pull-to-open installation\n检查接线是否接好\n检查开门位置是否安装正确\n可以将限位A 往外移一点，看门机是不是可以提前停下来\n还不行的话，拉耳转180度\n可以换限位试试",
    "content_en": "Ensure that the wires of the limit switch (BLUE, GREEN, and YELLOW wires of the arm) are not shorted. Confirm that each wire is properly inserted into its corresponding terminal and is not twisted with any other wire.\nPlease reconfirm the open position of your gate. For Pull-to-Open Installation Mode, the open position is determined by the gate bracket. Please check if the moving rod is properly retracted as instructed in the picture below when your gate is at the desired open position. Adjust the gate bracket inward a little if necessary.\nIf it does not work, please adjust Limit Switch A outward on the arm, then press the remote to open the gate and see if the open position changes. If not so, rotate the Front Mount 180° and test again.\nIf there is still no luck, the limit switch might be defective.",
